## Acceptance criteria

*Owner: `acceptance-criteria-writer`. Given/When/Then format; one scenario tests a single
behavior. Cover happy path + errors + boundaries — not just the happy one.*

- **Happy path** — Given {{initial-condition}}, When {{action}}, Then {{observable-outcome}}.
- **Error/boundary** — Given {{boundary-condition}}, When {{action}}, Then {{rejection-or-error-outcome}}.
